{"audit_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002:false-negative:round-0002","completed_at":"2026-07-30T17:32:00+08:00","cycle_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002","error_semantics":"routing_disagreement_v1","expansion_required":true,"expansion_symbols":{"price_watch":["CN:000068","CN:000062","CN:000099","CN:000151","CN:000096"]},"major_disagreement_count":1,"material_error_count":1,"plan_sha256":"69edca7924e2a1a5011f60a2069225045ef4e1ac22754f3cd64f32a7112d5946","policy":{"policy_id":"triage-quality-audit.default","sha256":"38aa9eb6ff0ac130e9b6e8c26ab54618455ac57540c9bab8a58ebd0bbe5c75f9","version":"1.0.0"},"portfolio_action":null,"redo_required":false,"redo_strata":[],"reopen_required":true,"reopen_symbols":["CN:000061"],"reviewed_count":3,"rows":[{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002:false-negative:round-0002:CN-000058","major_disagreement":false,"material_error":false,"original_disposition":"price_watch","recommended_disposition":"price_watch","review":{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002:false-negative:round-0002:CN-000058","decisive_question":"电子市场流通与检验检测两项较高毛利业务能否在未来四个季度持续扩大扣非利润和自由现金流，同时证明惠州群星代偿及赛格新城市法拍损失已经封顶，从而使约79.8亿元市值获得可验证的盈利支撑？","facts_packet_sha256":"eb2acba87e9a1e0b473e64958cdd3734f1709f83d6c5dd5b0efd02e81c054a2e","findings":[{"category":"valuation_and_earnings_quality","finding_id":"valuation_vs_earnings_001","severity":"material","source_ids":["s2_tencent_kline_20260729","s1_2025_annual_report","s1_2026_q1"],"statement":"按2026年7月29日6.48元及12.312亿股计算，A/B股合计隐含市值约79.8亿元，约为2026年一季度末归母净资产20.38亿元的3.9倍；而2025年扣非归母净利润仅0.11亿元，2026年一季度扣非归母净利润0.26亿元。即使简单年化一季度扣非利润，估值仍约77倍，当前价格缺少可验证的盈利安全垫。"},{"category":"asset_quality","finding_id":"legacy_impairment_002","severity":"major","source_ids":["s1_2025_impairment","s1_2025_annual_report"],"statement":"2025年新增资产减值准备1.30亿元、减少利润总额1.16亿元，期末累计减值准备6.35亿元；其中惠州赛格假日广场二期开发成本单项计提0.43亿元，新东升资产组亦发生大额商誉减值，表明地产存货和并购资产的账面价值仍存在实质性压力。"},{"category":"contingent_liability_and_credit_risk","finding_id":"guarantee_default_003","severity":"major","source_ids":["s1_20260722_guarantee_payment"],"statement":"惠州群星未能按期偿还银行借款，赛格地产截至2026年7月已累计代偿2,042.81万元；被担保方2026年一季度末净资产为负2.38亿元、资产负债率164.06%，且当季继续亏损280.02万元，反担保债权的回收能力高度脆弱，后续代偿风险尚未封顶。"},{"category":"asset_realization_and_litigation","finding_id":"judicial_enforcement_004","severity":"material","source_ids":["s1_20260623_judicial_auction"],"statement":"并表企业赛格新城市因约0.99亿元返还款判决进入恢复执行，法院安排其52套房产整体司法拍卖；成交价格及其相对账面价值的损益影响尚无法判断，存量地产资产的可变现价值存在进一步下修风险。"},{"category":"operating_recovery","finding_id":"recovery_durability_005","severity":"material","source_ids":["s1_2026_q1","s1_2025_annual_report"],"statement":"2026年一季度扣非归母净利润同比增长3.92%至0.26亿元，是避免直接停止跟踪的积极信号，但同期营业收入下降7.42%、经营现金流净额仍为负0.26亿元；结合2025年第四季度扣非亏损0.69亿元，单季利润改善尚不足以证明盈利已进入可持续上行周期。"}],"provenance":{"agent":"/root/quality2_000063/quality2_cont_000058","generated_at":"2026-07-30T17:19:27+08:00","model":"gpt-5","tools":["shell_command","Invoke-WebRequest","python:pypdf"]},"recommended_disposition":"price_watch","schema_version":1,"symbol":"CN:000058"},"symbol":"CN:000058"},{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002:false-negative:round-0002:CN-000061","major_disagreement":true,"material_error":true,"original_disposition":"price_watch","recommended_disposition":"conditional_stop","review":{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002:false-negative:round-0002:CN-000061","decisive_question":"未来两个季度能否在剔除土地处置等非经常收益后持续实现扣非利润同比增长，同时使经营现金流覆盖长期资产投入，并停止武汉海吉星等亏损项目的新增资金占用？","facts_packet_sha256":"d35aa2cd9caee3019ab2d198fc79e44507b1d109b1887b9d55965f6da04d8b16","findings":[{"category":"earnings_quality","finding_id":"earnings-quality-001","severity":"material","source_ids":["cninfo-2025-annual-1225214296","cninfo-2026-q1-1225214307"],"statement":"2025年扣非归母净利润2.10亿元，同比下降28.23%，第四季度扣非亏损627万元，全年信用减值损失1.02亿元；2026年一季度扣非归母净利润同比增长21.68%至0.77亿元，显示成本和减值改善，但归母净利润1.35亿元中包含土地收回形成的5,717万元处置收益，核心盈利反转尚需更多季度确认。"},{"category":"capital_intensity_and_liquidity","finding_id":"capital-intensity-002","severity":"material","source_ids":["cninfo-2025-annual-1225214296","cninfo-2026-q1-1225214307","cninfo-scp-1225381203"],"statement":"2025年购建长期资产现金支出13.22亿元，高于经营现金流净额9.07亿元；2026年一季度末短期借款、长期借款及应付债券合计约65.97亿元，而货币资金与交易性金融资产合计约27.87亿元，流动资产仅约为流动负债的0.65倍。公司虽以1.69%和1.39%的低利率发行中票及超短融，但重点项目扩张仍依赖持续融资。"},{"category":"investee_and_project_risk","finding_id":"stressed-projects-003","severity":"material","source_ids":["cninfo-2025-annual-1225214296","cninfo-wuhan-aid-1225418123"],"statement":"武汉海吉星2025年末净资产为负5.21亿元、年度亏损0.78亿元，公司当年已代其偿还银行贷款4,924.81万元并形成债权；截至2026年3月13日另有1,923.46万元借款到期未偿，7月8日又有607.41万元到期且项目仍无充足还款资金。公司已计提减值，但亏损项目的后续资金占用和回收仍是现实风险。"},{"category":"capital_returns_and_valuation","finding_id":"capital-return-004","severity":"material","source_ids":["eastmoney-000061-20260729-close","cninfo-2025-annual-1225214296","cninfo-2026-q1-1225214307","cninfo-dividend-1225379243"],"statement":"按7月29日收盘价5.88元及19.85亿股总股本计算，市值约116.7亿元，对应2025年全面摊薄市盈率约31.3倍、2026年一季度末市净率约1.35倍；每股年度现金分红0.06元对应股息率约1.02%，而2025年加权ROE仅5.38%。在扣非盈利和自由现金流尚未形成持续上行前，当前价格缺乏足够回报缓冲。"}],"provenance":{"agent":"/root/quality2_000066/quality2_cont_000061","generated_at":"2026-07-30T17:25:45+08:00","model":"gpt-5","tools":["shell_command","pypdf"]},"recommended_disposition":"conditional_stop","schema_version":1,"symbol":"CN:000061"},"symbol":"CN:000061"},{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002:false-negative:round-0002:CN-000089","major_disagreement":false,"material_error":false,"original_disposition":"price_watch","recommended_disposition":"price_watch","review":{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002:false-negative:round-0002:CN-000089","decisive_question":"剔除并表重估和土地整备补偿后，公司能否在客货流量仅低个位数增长的环境下持续实现扣非利润双位数增长，并使主营回报足以覆盖较高的租赁与融资固定负担？","facts_packet_sha256":"96555c15e596f0fbef690a9b3160badcc907f576be19081ecaa240f449b55bfc","findings":[{"category":"earnings_quality","finding_id":"F1","severity":"major","source_ids":["s1_2026_h1_forecast","s1_2026_q1_report"],"statement":"2026年上半年归母净利润预计为6.70亿至7.70亿元、同比增长114.59%至146.61%，但快件中心并表重估及土地整备搬迁补偿合计贡献约4.00亿至4.50亿元非经常性损益；同期扣非净利润仅为2.62亿至2.869亿元、同比增长0.43%至9.97%，存在一次性收益掩盖主营盈利改善幅度有限及后续利润回落的风险。"},{"category":"operating_momentum","finding_id":"F2","severity":"material","source_ids":["s1_2026_h1_forecast","s1_2026_june_operations","s1_2025_annual_report"],"statement":"2026年上半年旅客吞吐量和航班起降架次分别仅同比增长3.21%和1.15%；6月货邮吞吐量同比下降8.18%，其中国内货邮下降13.05%，国际旅客亦下降1.21%，显示流量增速趋弱，固定成本较高的机场业务面临经营杠杆不足风险。"},{"category":"fixed_obligations","finding_id":"F3","severity":"material","source_ids":["s1_2026_q1_report","s1_2025_annual_report"],"statement":"截至2026年一季度末，公司租赁负债约67.92亿元、长期借款约31.92亿元；2025年财务费用约3.28亿元、利息费用约3.53亿元，而2025年扣非净利润仅约4.24亿元。较重的租赁和融资固定负担可能限制低个位数流量增长向股东回报的转化。"},{"category":"related_party_dependence","finding_id":"F4","severity":"material","source_ids":["s1_2026_related_transactions"],"statement":"公司预计2026年度日常关联交易总额约14.12亿元，其中接受关联方劳务、租赁等服务约10.37亿元；公司亦明确其与机场集团存在一定相互依赖。关联方提供的土地、停机坪、房屋和后勤保障对运营具有必要性，形成持续的定价、治理及资源依赖风险。"}],"provenance":{"agent":"/root/triage2_000156/quality2_cont_000089","generated_at":"2026-07-30T17:29:51+08:00","model":"gpt-5","tools":["shell_command","python","requests","pypdf"]},"recommended_disposition":"price_watch","schema_version":1,"symbol":"CN:000089"},"symbol":"CN:000089"}],"schema_version":1,"status":"reopen_required","strata":[{"major_disagreement_count":0,"material_error_count":0,"material_error_rate_threshold":0.1,"next_sample_symbols":[],"observed_material_error_rate":0.0,"over_threshold":false,"population_count":0,"reviewed_count":0,"stratum":"catalog"},{"major_disagreement_count":1,"material_error_count":1,"material_error_rate_threshold":0.1,"next_sample_symbols":["CN:000068","CN:000062","CN:000099","CN:000151","CN:000096"],"observed_material_error_rate":0.3333333333333333,"over_threshold":true,"population_count":11,"reviewed_count":3,"stratum":"price_watch"},{"major_disagreement_count":0,"material_error_count":0,"material_error_rate_threshold":0.0,"next_sample_symbols":[],"observed_material